// The dialect-agnostic LLM layer: the IR every dialect trades in — modelled
// on pi.dev's `Context` — plus the `Dialect` trait each provider protocol
// implements, the `StreamEvent`s it decodes to, what a `ModelInfo` says a
// model can be asked for, the `Registry` that ties providers to protocols,
// and the `LlmTransport` that carries the bytes.
//
// No `supported_targets`: this has to compile to wasm-gc, because a page
// lowering and lifting for itself is the deployment this exists to allow.
// Only `wire`, which reads an environment and opens a socket, is native.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/json",
}
